#: modules/User Admin/import_users.php:52
msgid ""
"This page allows you to import user data from a CSV file. The import "
"includes all users, whether they be students, staff, parents or other. The "
"system will take the import and set any existing users not present in the "
"file to \"Left\", whilst importing new users into the system. New users will "
"be assigned a random password, unless a default is set. Select the CSV file "
"you wish to use for the synchronise operation."
msgstr ""
"這一頁允許你從一件 CSV 文件輸入用戶數據。這個輸入包括全部用戶，是否他們是學"
"生，員工，家長或其他。當正在輸入新的用戶進去系統時，系統會將採取輸入和設置任"
"何存在但沒有出現的用戶到 \"左\"。新的用戶會將被指派到一個烏龜的密碼，除非已經"
"設置了一個默認。   選擇你希望使用的 CSV 文件給同步行動。      "

